# Documentation site

- Docs are MDX under `content/`. Add/update the nearest `_meta.ts` when adding a page.
- Runtime closed loop: `POST /invocations` then `POST /response` (singular). Never `/responses`.
- `/invocations` `params` is a JSON **string**.
- Do not invent algorithm `approach` / `sub_approach` IDs. Match `ecosystem-runtime` / `ECOSYSTEM_ALGORITHMS.md`.
- Dev server: `pnpm dev` on port 3333. Preview doc edits; there is no unit-test suite.
- Components: shadcn/ui patterns, `cn()` from `lib/utils.ts`.
